All done. Here's a summary of what was implemented:

## Summary

### New crate: `polkagent-kit` (PRD-12 §10 — Product Kit manifest & lifecycle)

**`crates/polkagent-kit/src/manifest.rs`** — Kit manifest TOML format with sections:
- `[kit]` — metadata: name, version, description, authors, license  
- `[capabilities]` — required_grants list (checked against Cedar-style grants)
- `[skills]` — skill entries with `version` (semver requirement) and `role` (primary/required/optional/context)
- `[defaults]` — target_networks, auto_activate
- `[policy]` — chain_write, data_classification
- `[ux]` — display_name, short_description, category
- `KitId` — name@version identifier, matching the existing `SkillId`/`PluginId` pattern
- Full validation: kebab-case names, semver versions, semver requirement parsing, must have ≥1 skill

**`crates/polkagent-kit/src/manager.rs`** — Install/uninstall lifecycle:
- `validate_kit()` — reads `kit.toml`, validates capabilities against grants, checks required skills against installed skills
- `prepare_install()` — builds an `InstalledKit` record from a validated manifest
- `skills_to_unregister()` — returns non-optional skill names to remove on uninstall

**`crates/polkagent-kit/src/error.rs`** — `KitError` enum with `ManifestParse`, `ManifestInvalid`, `InvalidVersion`, `CapabilityDenied`, `NotInstalled`, etc.

### CLI commands added to `polkagent-cli`:

- **`polkagent kit install <path>`** — parses `kit.toml`, validates capabilities & skill availability, persists to `kits` SQLite table (supports `--json`)
- **`polkagent kit uninstall <name>`** — removes kit + its registered skills from SQLite (supports `--yes` to skip prompt)
- **`polkagent kit list`** — lists all installed kits with name, version, skill count, description (supports `--json`)

### Files modified:
- `Cargo.toml` — added `crates/polkagent-kit` to workspace members
- `crates/polkagent-cli/Cargo.toml` — added `polkagent-kit` dependency
- `crates/polkagent-cli/src/cli.rs` — added `Kit(KitCmd)` variant + `KitCmd`/`KitInstallCmd`/`KitUninstallCmd`/`KitListCmd` structs
- `crates/polkagent-cli/src/commands/mod.rs` — added `pub mod kit`
- `crates/polkagent-cli/src/main.rs` — wired `Commands::Kit` dispatch

